From: Pulsar Bot <pulsar@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] seccomp: add SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF + notify addfd

Backport of seccomp user notification (SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF) from
Linux 5.0 and seccomp notify addfd (SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_ADDFD) from
Linux 5.9, ported to the e404 4.19 CAF base.

Adds:
  - SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF action
  - struct seccomp_knotif (in-kernel notification state)
  - seccomp_notify_* file ops for the supervisor fd
  - SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_RECV/SEND/ID_VALID/ADDFD ioctls
  - SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_NEW_LISTENER flag

Required: 0000-task-fd-install.patch must be applied first.

NOTE: This patch adds SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF infrastructure from
scratch since the e404 base (4.19.404 staging-bpf) does not have it.
The seccomp_filter struct is extended with notify_lock + knotif list.

